Game Update | 1.25.05.15:4004
Changelog:
 Fixed & updated Server to check the new Alaska location;
 Fixed a possible null exception in fish destroy when a player enters the room as a client;
 Fixed missing particle in the fishing boat (Thailand);
 Fixed Alaska map rankings;
 Fixed white cubes from Rainbow Trout in Alaska.

New
 New Trophy Lodge (Residence) [Preview];
 Fish growth and death cycles on all maps. [Preview];
 Added EXP boost when catching fish that exceed the equipment’s durability [Preview];
 Added Horizons to all maps.
Changes
 Updated a drag burst sound effect when the fist strikes, with the pitch varying based on the reel's drag setting. Disabled the effect if the drag is set to 100%.
 Disabled lens dirt in Beautify;
 Adjusted water transparency in Thailand and Zalasie;
 Thailand map colliders adjusted& trees rescaled;
 Weather presets updated for Residence and Tutorial;
 Azure reflection probe update optimized (refreshes only when the map time changes);
 Disabled chromatic aberration and lens distortion in underwater cameras;
 Disabled reeling-out sound when casting at short distances.
 Excluded Slovakia water movement collider from fishing equipment collisions, fixing ground bait issues.
 Disabled Sun Flares effect (temporarily disabled until we fix the occlusion mask)
 Changes in water reflections
Fixes
 Fixed underwater colors;
 Fixed missing audio for Escape menu tiles;
 Fixed aquarium sound disappearing when opening the menu UI in Residence;
 Fixed the residence music bug (music now plays correctly inside the building);
 Fixed white cubes appearing near the hook;
 Fixed fish pickup indicator in the catch panel;
 Fixed null reference issue in the Weather Manager upon entering Tutorial or Residence;
 Fixed incorrect location time after returning from the Residence;
 Fixed Water Planar and SSR bugs causing water visuals to degrade after changing settings;
 Fixed Trophy Room lighting and values issues;
Preview Features
As you can see we marked 3 features as a "preview". That means we need feedback from you regarding this things.

Based on the latest community feedback, we introduced the extra EXP for catching bigger fish for light gear - right now, EXP is limited, but we will vary it based on the gap between gear durability and fish weight. The bigger the gap, the bigger the EXP boost will be. 

We would like to hear your thoughts about the new Trophy Room. We will need to fix some lights, and I believe some of you could have perfo issues - we would like to get some feedback here.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36994199/a08995cbd422de5d561219be5d7d33fd1901538d.jpg
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36994199/886fc3b5202675bcf29a1a5ae3aa526e3ec96de5.jpg

Drag sounds - as requested - fixed.

Thank you, everyone, for dropping feedback & ideas.

Changelog:
 Fix exception errors occurring when the line is cut by a fish or the [Q] key
 Fixed missing sun references in Beautify plugin on scenes, causing errors in console after entering location;
 Fixed SplineBending errors showing in Kiel location;
 Fixed bug causing possible equipment damage when extracting fish, leading to invisible fish in the catch panel;
 Fixed the GPIUnstancer bug causing a large lag when the player returns from the menu, shop, or inventory back to gameplay;
 Fixed missing avatar head shadow and enabled head rendering when the camera is in bait/underwater mode;
 Fixed rod bending: IK bones now start closer to handle;
 Disable time and weather indicators in the top-right HUD corner;
 Slightly decrease the fight stats for the heaviest fish.

We’ve just rolled out a big update for our game, and we’re super excited for you to dive in! This update packs many changes — from a brand new fish system to a smoother multiplayer mode, not to mention a boatload of fixes to improve your gameplay.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36994199/e177f60a547764d6121cacb2eec7c4599be4bfc5.jpg

We’d love to hear what you think! Your feedback is super important to us, as it helps us fix bugs and make those tweaks that count. So, if you spot something off or have a cool idea, please drop us a line. Let’s make this game awesome together!

We are aware of a few visual glitches that should be fixed soon.

General
 Updated Unity engine to 2021.3 LTS;
 Updated and linked the new language service;
 Improved multiplayer mode with correct float synchronization and synchronized rod bending.
New/Added
 Added Multiplayer (with players 3D models & animations);
 New fish system (refactored and rewritten from the scratches. It also required intervening modifications to the gameplay code);
 Added the Smooth Sync;
 Added a new multiplayer UI panel;
 Added player names above avatars;
 Added time and weather details to multiplayer mode;
 Added error messages to the Multiplayer Manager;
 Created a way for players to exit if the connection drops during a game;
 Added avatars in the culling system;
 Added markers to show fish locations in the development build;
 Added a visual look for fish interacting with other players in the room;
 Synchronized equipment for multiplayer: rod, reel, and fishing line;
 Multiplayer synchronization of player equipment, including all items attached to the fishing line (hook, bait, lure);
 Added private rooms, including friend selection, room creation, and the ability to join private rooms;
 Added support for multiple local save locations to isolate save data between release and open testing branches;
 Added new Feeder UI Animation;
 Added new debug texts;
 Added beta information screen;
 Added the mechanism of spitting out bait after 15 seconds;
 Enabled room location changes in the Multiplayer Manager;
 Implemented a capsule avatar that works on the network;
 Added transparency to the player capsule avatar (multiplayer);
 Added missing localization to the Multiplayer UI;
 Added a full-body avatar of a woman;
 Added running motion to the full-body avatar;
 Added colliders to remote player avatars;
 Added third-person animations to remote avatars;
 Added a new Jackson Halloween map following corrective updates;
 Added boat ghost synchronization in multiplayer mode;
 Added middle-sized fish view in player's arms;
 Added view for big fish lying on the ground;
 Added Up-Down layer to full-body avatar animator to correct rod position, ensuring the reel is visible on screen;
 Added up and down steering of the rod according to the player's camera rotation in FPP;
 Added new minimaps for each map.
Changes & Improvements
 Changed fishing spawning on all maps;
 Changed fish animation and move speed;
 Changed reeling speed referred to fish strength;
 Changed fish jump power;
 Changed free movement dash ratio;
 Changed settings for fish in Thailand;
 Improved rod control during fish fights;
 Improved drag and line unwinding control;
 Fixed collision in the underwater camera;
 Improved fish animations in fight;
 Improved fish fight on 0 stamina;
 Improved fish fight and stamina drop;
 Improved rod bending;
 Improved fish fight;
 Improved fish water splash optimization (pooling);
 Improved and refactored HUD Manager (Water Pointer);
 Refactored fishing line;
 Refactored line tension;
 Refactored Water Pointer;
