 Corrected rod hand placement in the game;
 Enabled fish pick grip with a full-body avatar;
 Centered the fishing rod on the screen;
 Corrected fish send sub-test in server API testing;
 Made the first attempt to synchronize the avatar body in multiplayer (PUN);
 Limited the movement of the rod in players' hands in remote avatars to avoid clipping with the body;
 Implemented a dynamic check for the save directory using the Steam API;
 Set up water in the game after the update (adjustments needed on each map);
 Rearranged fish spawning areas;
 Forced LOD 0 on fish catch screen;
 Optimized Russia map.
Fixes
 Fixed spawn points on all maps;
 Fixed collisions with fish spawners;
 Fixed Crepuscular camera turning off;
 Fixed underwater object disappearance when changing the camera;
 Fixed bait disappearance after selling or collecting the fish;
 Removed duplicate player names from the chat list;
 Blocked camera rotation when the menu is open in the location scene;
 Fixed topwater lure camera;
 Fixed missing textures in Slovakia;
 Disabled chat API from the dedicated server;
 Fixed null exception when SetRandomWaypoint() finds no target point;
 Fish local avoidance reverted raycasting queue;
 Fixed fish speed during a fight;
 Fixed foliage drawing in Thailand;
 Prevented players from equipping inappropriate rods (incorrect level) during tournaments;
 Restricted equipment availability in the shop during tournaments;
 Changed tournament server address;
 Corrected the instability of the float when retrieving fish from water;
 Fixed grip appearing in hand after closing the fish catch panel;
 Fixed toggle for angler view with the 'C' key;
 Fixed rod visibility that was not showing/hiding part of the equipment and rope when switching angler view;
 Fixed FOV adjustment in-game settings;
 Fixed a bug that randomly blocked fish extraction from water, preventing the catch panel from showing up;
 Fixed the jumping animation for the avatar;
 Fixed ZoomCamera overlay not disappearing when binoculars are not in use;
 Fixed the issue with incorrect fish culling in multiplayer;
 Locked large fish in the tutorial to prevent issues with catching a fish;
 Disabled line cutting [Q key] while the player is casting or has caught a fish;
 Corrected fish culling/spawning to avoid no fish zones in multiplayer mode;
 Synced rod supports in multiplayer mode;
 Fixed the incorrect bait take when the player uses multiple rods on a support;
 Fixed the bug where signals were not reacting with sound and lights;
 Fixed the ‘BACK’ button not working when in the profile;
 Corrected displacement of the float, ensuring it responds to the weight;
 Fixed slow float resurfacing;
 Corrected issue with the whitish shine of FLUO floats during the day;
 Addressed artificial bait behavior at 10% speed;
 Fixed ‘Eagle Eye’ activation with the float view above water;
 Removed fish fight state debug log, smoothed the underwater follow, and corrected camera change post fish fight;
 Refactored fish entity to fix bugs with multiple rods in use;
 Fixed the shadow distance setting slider;
 Fixed bug where fish are missing in the tutorial;
 Fixed bug that prevents setting the float depth in the tutorial;
 Disabled photo mode camera (dev);
 Resolved the issue where the bug report panel fails to display (set up SRDebugger);
 Ensured the loading panel fades out correctly in the Residence location.

